  "report": {
    "uncertain": [
      "Inazuma family (イナズマダブルキック 'Inazuma Double Kick', スーパーイナズマキック 'Super Inazuma Kick', ウルトライナズマキック 'Ultra Inazuma Kick'): the table's base イナズマキック is Jigoku's 'Inazuma Kick', so I kept 'Inazuma' in the derived names. The battle voice says 'Lightning Kick' every time (about 26 lines in g010/g160/g195/g196). The table and the voice disagree, and one of them should be aligned.",
      "サスマタコレダー = 'Sasumata Collider', to match the table's バスターコレダー 'Buster Collider' and Noriko's voice 'Buster Collider'. Nono's voice (g195) says 'Sasumata Koreda', which contradicts this.",
      "バスター雷王落とし = 'Buster Jupiter II Drop', using the glossary's 雷王星 'Jupiter II' (still status proposed) and the story's '$$雷王星$$ drop'. If 雷王星 changes (name_research once proposed 'Raiousei'), this name must change too.",
      "連続射撃 / 連続格闘 (Sinanju) = 'Rapid Fire' / 'Melee Combo', and ビーム・マグナム連続射撃 = 'Beam Magnum Rapid Fire'. These are coined. Jigoku's 連続攻撃 is 'Combo Attack', so 'Combo' is used only for the melee one.",
      "ロケットパンチ１００連発 = 'Rocket Punch 100-Shot Barrage' (Kouji's voice says 'Hundred-Shot Barrage'). The word 'Barrage' also renders 一斉攻撃 elsewhere.",
      "（ドゥーズミーユ） kept as '(Douze-Mille)' with the parentheses, as in the source.",
      "２５ｍｍビーム機関砲 short = '25mm Beam Cannon'. 'Autocannon' does not fit in 18 characters.",
      "中口径速射インパクトキャノン short = '55mm Impact Cannon', taken from the paired full name (AA-55/QD 55mm). Plain 'Impact Cannon' is already the same unit's インパクト・カノン.",
      "重量子ビームガンポッド・バースト / ・バーストモード share records (short and full column of the same weapon). Their shorts are 'Gun Pod Burst' and 'Gun Pod Burst Mode', which follow Alto's voice 'Gunpod! Burst Mode!'."
    ],
    "notes": "Owners were resolved through the wpn-1r table (robot id, count, first weapon). Reused Jigoku English for every exact match: Gatling Gun Pod, MDE Beam Cannon, Sniper Rifle (Precision), Ghost, Rapid-Fire Impact Cannon, Laser Pulse Gun, Impact Cannon, Machine Gun Turret, Quarter Cannon, 25mm Machine Gun. Battle voice matched for Buster Home Run, Buster Collider, Evil Geyser, Buster Haken, Buster Sword Straight Slash, Buster Megatech PK, Buster Racket, Buster Smash, POWER TO THE DREAM. Official Gundam names: Armed Armor BS/VN/DE, Revolving Launcher, Shield Funnel, Incom, Psycho-Shard (glossary). 真シャインスパーク = 'Shin Shine Spark' (settled)."
  }
}
